---Routine entry:
 s maxFrames=127 
 ; Note we are already in one frame hence the -1
 s numberOfFramesLeft=maxFrames-1 
 ; recursive to the overflow limit
 d recursive(numberOfFramesLeft) 
 q
recursive(numberOfFramesLeft)
 i numberOfFramesLeft do recursive(numberOfFramesLeft-1)
 q

---RuntimeError:
DO stack overflow (max 127)
